<% content_for :title, "How it works · rspack_rails demo" %>

<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">How this page was built</h1>
<p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">You got here through Turbo Drive: no full page load, and the React list on the first page is unmounted and mounted again when you go back.</p>

<ol class="mt-8 space-y-4">
  <% [
    ["rails new + template.rb", "The default importmap app, migrated to rspack, with Stimulus, TypeScript, React and Tailwind."],
    ["bin/dev", "Rails and rspack serve side by side. Rails proxies /rspack/* to the dev server, so hot updates arrive on the same origin."],
    ["assets:precompile", "Runs rspack build into app/assets/builds; Propshaft fingerprints the files into public/assets. Chunks already carry a hash (.digested.js)."],
    ["kamal deploy", "The Dockerfile installs Node.js only in the build stage. The final image has no node_modules."]
  ].each_with_index do |(title, body), index| %>
    <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
      <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-sm font-semibold text-white"><%= index + 1 %></span>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-mono font-semibold"><%= title %></h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600"><%= body %></p>
      </div>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ol>
